  "behaviour": [
    "Short acknowledgements require one delivered message among the recipient's currently installed pinned protocols.",
    "Optional genesis:radio or genesis:service (contract alias) binds both protocol ID and current hash.",
    "Selection and persistence run under one RadioService monitor. Save failure preserves in-memory snapshots and saved bytes.",
    "Explicit acknowledgement removes only a delivery; inbox remains responsible for applying valid contract messages.",
    "Original wire protocols, hashes, sequence reservation and schema-v1 persistence remain unchanged."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No new Paper/Folia live workflow, human, throughput, production capacity or real provider evidence was added for this fix.",
    "This is post-RC4 SNAPSHOT source. The already verified RC4 JAR is unchanged and still contains the old ambiguous command selection.",
    "No automatic radio log rotation or sequence reuse was introduced. Full retained history still rejects new messages.",
    "Temporary-key signature checks do not sign an official release or establish an operational trust root."
  ],
